    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      486.48,
      310.14,
      532.55
    ],
    "text": "The notice is hereby given by the sub section (1) in thesection 7 of the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act No: 28 of1964 that the government intends to acquire the below men-tioned land/servitude for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      546.48,
      282.88,
      556.55
    ],
    "text": "The description of the land/servitude to be acquired-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      570.48,
      309.89,
      652.55
    ],
    "text": "The allotment which had been extended in 2.0530 hectaresfrom the land named as Pathraketiyawaththa andGorakagahakumbura which had been described as lot No. 01in the preliminary plan no.G 4306 dated 17.02.2018 surveyedand prepared by the Surveyor General,Galle and located inthe Kobeithuduwa village, Divisional Secretariat,Ambalangoda in the Galle District.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      666.48,
      309.71,
      688.55
    ],
    "text": "The all claimants and people who have ownerships orother relation to the aforementioned land/servitude them-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      414.96,
      561.87,
      449.03
    ],
    "text": "selves or the people who are authorized by their documentsshould be appeared befor me at 10.00 a. m. on 2019-06 -06, atthe Divisional Secretariat - Ambalangoda.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      462.96,
      562.31,
      569.03
    ],
    "text": "Futher, the nature of their ownerships related to the men-tioned land,details on the facts for claiming compensationregarding the acquiring that land,the amount of compensa-tion and the way it was calculated shall be received to me byduly completed two copies prior to the date of 2019-05-23Relevant deed of transfers and other particulars should alsobe brought on the date in which examination is due to be heldin order to confirm the own obligations or rights with regardto the lands.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
